+---
+id: ex-aqft-finite-z2-cocycle-circle
+kind: example
+title: A nontrivial cocycle weight on the finite two-element gauge groupoid
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+dependency_level: 3
